<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore URA awards land tender for S$508 mln.</title>
<headline>Singapore URA awards land tender for S$508 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Urban Redevelopment Authority (URA) said on Monday it awarded a land tender for Singapore $508 million to United Overseas Land Ltd and United Overseas Bank Ltd.</p>
</text>
